[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11406.95, "timestamp": "03:10:06", "text": "现在拿起杯子。马克杯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11409.429, "timestamp": "03:10:09", "text": "等等，上面写的是什么？世界最伟大的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11413.19, "timestamp": "03:10:13", "text": "指挥官。那完全是我的。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11415.99, "timestamp": "03:10:15", "text": "咖啡指挥官。我的天啊。你这混蛋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11420.389, "timestamp": "03:10:20", "text": "你毁了我的咖啡。没什么大损失。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11422.87, "timestamp": "03:10:22", "text": "你偷的，伙计。这个偷东西的家伙"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11426.71, "timestamp": "03:10:26", "text": "现在。你会拿回来的。我就是那个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11431.269, "timestamp": "03:10:31", "text": "只提供咖啡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11433.51, "timestamp": "03:10:33", "text": "这是唯一一位指挥官。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11437.03, "timestamp": "03:10:37", "text": "哎呀，就差一点点。我几乎可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11439.03, "timestamp": "03:10:39", "text": "尝尝那阿克图瑞安超级黑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11440.95, "timestamp": "03:10:40", "text": "已经。赶紧回店里去。来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11450.309, "timestamp": "03:10:50", "text": "等待。还有什么我遗漏的吗？我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11458.07, "timestamp": "03:10:58", "text": "美好的。我也很好。是的，我正在做"}]